  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.26 Technical statement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.26 “Technical statement\" means a substantive statement providing a party’s position or conclusion on a particular matter and the underlying analysis that led the party to the position(s) or conclusion(s), provided in the form of a report or statement and distinct from the analysis provided by counsel in a legal memo.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
}
